  "description": "<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(37, 37, 37, 0.75); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Welcome to the Emma Cruises' Store, created by me, Emma Cruises.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(37, 37, 37, 0.75); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Whether you're cruising the Caribbean or just dreaming of your next&nbsp;trip,&nbsp;the products in our shop are&nbsp;sure to bring a smile to your face (and anyone else who sees them).&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(37, 37, 37, 0.75); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Our t-shirts are designed to help you create lasting memories on your cruise vacation by adding a touch of humour to your trip. They're also great souvenirs to take back home to remember your fantastic cruise.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(37, 37, 37, 0.75); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">We focus on creating t-shirts and merchandise that are perfect for anyone who loves to cruise, whether you're a seasoned sailor or just setting sail for the first time.</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(37, 37, 37, 0.75); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Our designs are inspired by my&nbsp;experiences and observations while cruising, as well as the community of cruise lovers&nbsp;who I've met over the years.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgba(37, 37, 37, 0.75); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Thank you for visiting our store, and we hope you enjoy browsing our collection of funny cruise-inspired t-shirts.&nbsp;Laters alligators.</p>",
